---
import { SUPPLEMENTS_HIGHLIGHT, TECH_HIGHLIGHT } from '../data/catalog';
---

<section id="beneficios" class="section section-light" aria-labelledby="beneficios-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">COMPLEMENTOS DEL ECOSISTEMA</span>
      <h2 id="beneficios-heading" class="section-title">
        Conoce nuestros productos y servicios <span class="accent">adicionales para ti</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Tecnología operativa real para reducir esperas en recepción, gestionar pedidos de suplementos con stock verificado y proteger tus datos personales.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="addons-grid">
      <article class="addon-card">
        <div class="addon-media">
          <img
            src={SUPPLEMENTS_HIGHLIGHT.image}
            alt={SUPPLEMENTS_HIGHLIGHT.imageAlt}
            width="640"
            height="420"
            class="addon-img"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="sync"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="addon-content">
          <span class="addon-overline">{SUPPLEMENTS_HIGHLIGHT.overline}</span>
          <h3>{SUPPLEMENTS_HIGHLIGHT.title}</h3>
          <p>{SUPPLEMENTS_HIGHLIGHT.description}</p>
          <div class="addon-actions">
            <a href="/descargar" class="btn btn-primary">Ver Catálogo en App Móvil</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="addon-card">
        <div class="addon-media">
          <img
            src={TECH_HIGHLIGHT.image}
            alt={TECH_HIGHLIGHT.imageAlt}
            width="640"
            height="420"
            class="addon-img"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="sync"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="addon-content">
          <span class="addon-overline">{TECH_HIGHLIGHT.overline}</span>
          <h3>{TECH_HIGHLIGHT.title}</h3>
          <p>{TECH_HIGHLIGHT.description}</p>
          <div class="addon-actions">
            <a href="/eliminar-cuenta" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Canal ARCO Ley N° 29733</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="addons-note">
      * La disponibilidad física de suplementos, marcas y lotes en stock se actualiza directamente desde el Kardex en recepción y puede consultarse desde la App Móvil.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .addons-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .addon-card {
    background-color: var(--vf-bg-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--vf-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .addon-media {
    min-height: 260px;
    background-color: var(--vf-bg-dark);
  }

  .addon-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 22%;
  }

  .addon-content {
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .addon-overline {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--vf-gold-ink);
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }

  .addon-content h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--vf-ink);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .addon-content p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--vf-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .addons-note {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--vf-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1020px) {
    .addons-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 580px) {
    .addon-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .addon-media {
      min-height: 200px;
      max-height: 240px;
    }
  }
</style>
